{"id":182590660,"slug":"on-the-last-day-of-christmas-a-frontier","title":"A Frontier Psychiatrists Holiday Anthology","subtitle":"All the Christmas Posts I've Written Over The Years","post_date":"2025-12-26T13:24:15.580Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/on-the-last-day-of-christmas-a-frontier","wordcount":324,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:45:22.490Z","body_sha256":"94c7edafc0451792789c76e1ea41d644b5b2e3b7c53ce561865f69aaaa264a22","text_words":329,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Writing silly posts for the holidays has become a tradition over here.  Today, a tour down memory lane.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uyxy!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F64807bb6-4069-43bb-a738-18585148d569_5712x2890.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uyxy!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F64807bb6-4069-43bb-a738-18585148d569_5712x2890.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uyxy!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F64807bb6-4069-43bb-a738-18585148d569_5712x2890.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uyxy!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F64807bb6-4069-43bb-a738-18585148d569_5712x2890.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!uyxy!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F64807bb6-4069-43bb-